# Generated files are byte-compared against freshly generated output by
# `npm run schema:check`, which gates `npm run build`. The generator emits \n,
# so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite them to \r\n on
# disk and the guard would report a current file as STALE — blocking the build
# on Windows while passing in CI. Pinning them to LF keeps the bytes on disk
# identical to the bytes the generator writes, on every platform.
lib/schema-ddl.generated.js   text eol=lf
lib/schema-ddl.generated.d.ts text eol=lf
